WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Received an encrypted coordinate invitation

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,440
Discovered Chu Yunxuan, Brother Lin

3
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,800
Is there time to say no?

4
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:07,720
Find me at this time

5
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:32,620
I guess we're talking about the big exam, Brother Yuan

6
00:00:32,620 --> 00:00:33,940
This spaceship is so cool

7
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:39,050
These seats are sewn with gold-grade leather, don't touch them.

8
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:40,530
Don't talk nonsense when you get to the place.

9
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:43,010
Even though the Prairie God Realm where I am now is already rotten,

10
00:00:43,010 --> 00:00:46,810
But my group of black magic beads have gone crazy. Now they eat poison like jelly beans.

11
00:00:46,810 --> 00:00:47,890
aggressive laman

12
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:49,900
What’s the quantity?

13
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:52,000
Except for the constant thunder and lightning every day

14
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,160
The batch of rations sacrificed to you

15
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:55,400
I still have 25,000 heads in my divine domain.

16
00:00:55,400 --> 00:00:57,240
Most of them are around bronze four-star strength.

17
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,720
Just put this force among ordinary civilians

18
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:00,680
I'm definitely walking sideways, Brother Yuan

19
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:01,680
I've planned it all

20
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:02,960
It would be unavoidable to go to the devil for this big exam

21
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,280
I brought more than 20,000 beads with me

22
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,600
Landing on the outermost fringe

23
00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:06,760
Mining is always a duty

24
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:07,720
With my current strength

25
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:08,960
You can definitely mix it up safely
